OL,3,GNEWSACharity celebrating Mandela's
OL,4,Alegacy marks decade of work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new exhibition in Liverpool will
OL,7,Fshowcase the work of a city charity,
OL,8,Forganisers said.
OL,10,FTaking place at St George's Hall,
OL,11,FLiverpool's Mandela Story will
OL,12,Fhighlight the work of Mandela8 over the
OL,13,Fpast decade.
OL,15,FSonia Bassey, chair of Mandela8, said
OL,16,Fthe exhibition, taking place during
OL,17,FBlack History Month, is a chance to
OL,18,Freflect on the last ten years of
OL,19,Fcampaigning "carried out in Nelson
OL,20,FMandela's name" and an opportunity to
OL,21,F"look forward to the future with
OL,22,Foptimism".
